{"964": "<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"https://koloboros.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/canklg_website_banner_design_for_oroda_mg_ve_lturc_wide_21_comp_5d2177e7-2fd7-49c7-8000-19736d1e20fa.png?w=1600\",\"id\":451,\"dimRatio\":60,\"customOverlayColor\":\"#140e08\",\"isUserOverlayColor\":true,\"minHeight\":440,\"minHeightUnit\":\"px\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"oro-hero\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull oro-hero\" style=\"min-height:440px\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-60 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#140e08\"></span><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-451\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://koloboros.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/canklg_website_banner_design_for_oroda_mg_ve_lturc_wide_21_comp_5d2177e7-2fd7-49c7-8000-19736d1e20fa.png?w=1600\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hakkında</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oro-alinti\"} -->\n<p class=\"oro-alinti\">“Aynaya bakar gibi Oro’ya bakmaktasın; fakat bil ki bu ayna düz değildir.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oro-kaynak\"} -->\n<p class=\"oro-kaynak\">Önsöz: Alemgezer’e</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-bant oro-koyu\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}, \"align\": \"full\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull oro-bant oro-koyu\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-ic\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oro-ic\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-vitrin\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oro-vitrin\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":469,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://koloboros.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/oro_world_continents.png?w=1000\" alt=\"Oro kıtalarının haritası\" class=\"wp-image-469\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-vitrin-m\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oro-vitrin-m\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oro-etiket\"} -->\n<p class=\"oro-etiket\">Alemgezer’e</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\": \"oro\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"oro\">Oro Nedir?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Oro, âlemindeki zihinlerin döküntülerinden yoğrulmuş bir külliyattır. Tanrıları, diyarları, halkları, devletleri, büyüsü ve mahlukatıyla yazıldıkça genişleyen bir dünyadır.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Burada hiçbir hakikat tek bir kalemden çıkmaz. Bu sayfalardaki bilgiler Oro’nun kendi âlimlerinin, vakanüvislerinin, seyyahlarının ve kabirbazlarının yazdıklarından derlenmiştir. Kimi zaman birbirini yalanlarlar; okurun işi, hangisinin daha sağlam taşa bastığını sezmektir.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sana “Alemgezer” diye seslenilir. Zira bu satırları okuyan sen de, Oro’ya başka bir âlemin damlasından bakan bir yolcusun.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-bant\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}, \"align\": \"full\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull oro-bant\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-ic\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oro-ic\"><!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\": \"basla\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"basla\">Nereden Başlamalı?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oro-giris\"} -->\n<p class=\"oro-giris\">Hangi kapıdan girersen gir, unutma: Oro’da her göğe yükseliş, bir çukura inişin yankısıdır.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-ray\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oro-ray\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-kart\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oro-kart\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":805,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://koloboros.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/oro_world_original-1-1.jpg?w=900\" alt=\"Harita\" class=\"wp-image-805\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-kart-metin\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oro-kart-metin\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oro-etiket\"} -->\n<p class=\"oro-etiket\">Diyar diyar</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://koloboros.com/oro-kitalari-3b/\">Harita</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kıtaları gez, her bölgede yazılmış metinleri keşfet.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-kart\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oro-kart\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":456,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://koloboros.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/canklg_website_banner_design_for_oro_tarihi_wide_21_composition_6d33eafd-0828-494f-8735-e746583af889.png?w=900\" alt=\"Kronoloji\" class=\"wp-image-456\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-kart-metin\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oro-kart-metin\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oro-etiket\"} -->\n<p class=\"oro-etiket\">Sıfır Noktası</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://koloboros.com/oro-kronolojisi/\">Kronoloji</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ateş Engereği’nden Gecekoynu’nun ardına Oro tarihi.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-kart\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oro-kart\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":454,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://koloboros.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/canklg_website_banner_design_for_oro_sosyo-biyolojisi_wide_21_c_5e64d1ed-befb-480b-ab81-ffc66819700b.png?w=900\" alt=\"Sözlük\" class=\"wp-image-454\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-kart-metin\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oro-kart-metin\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oro-etiket\"} -->\n<p class=\"oro-etiket\">Lügatçe</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://koloboros.com/oro-sozlugu/\">Sözlük</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>İlahlar, soylar, büyü ve mahlukatın kısa kaydı.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-kart\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oro-kart\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":925,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://koloboros.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/gemini_generated_image_4q693h4q693h4q69.jpeg?w=900\" alt=\"Kitaplar\" class=\"wp-image-925\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-kart-metin\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oro-kart-metin\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oro-etiket\"} -->\n<p class=\"oro-etiket\">Oro Serisi</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://koloboros.com/kitaplar/\">Kitaplar</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nebrukaddesar ve dokuz ciltlik Oro Kütüphanesi.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-bant oro-cam\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}, \"align\": \"full\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull oro-bant oro-cam\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-ic\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oro-ic\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oro-etiket\"} -->\n<p class=\"oro-etiket\">Oro Kıtaları</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\": \"instagram\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"instagram\">Instagram’da Bizi Takip Et</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oro-giris\"} -->\n<p class=\"oro-giris\">Yeni çizimler, haritalar ve kitap haberleri ilk orada paylaşılır. Oro’ya her gün bir pencere aç.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"oro-satin\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons oro-satin\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/koloboros/\">@koloboros</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-mozaik\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oro-mozaik\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":641,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/koloboros/\"><img src=\"https://koloboros.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/0_12829296750141641365768133.jpg?w=500\" alt=\"Oro Kıtaları Instagram seçkisi\" class=\"wp-image-641\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":658,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/koloboros/\"><img src=\"https://koloboros.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/0_32841293476910249426759994.jpg?w=500\" alt=\"Oro Kıtaları Instagram seçkisi\" class=\"wp-image-658\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":718,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/koloboros/\"><img src=\"https://koloboros.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/canklg_a_detailed_close-up_photograph_of_the_mysterious_artifac_30525645-2f3e-464b-8fa4-cea794b098f2.png?w=500\" alt=\"Oro Kıtaları Instagram seçkisi\" class=\"wp-image-718\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":727,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/koloboros/\"><img src=\"https://koloboros.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/canklg_a_striking_cinematic_oil_painting_of_a_solitary_umaqan_49dbf1bd-028b-4782-9fbc-06a4fe0e62e6_1.png?w=500\" alt=\"Oro Kıtaları Instagram seçkisi\" class=\"wp-image-727\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":656,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/koloboros/\"><img src=\"https://koloboros.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/0_32838295300843305814168968.jpg?w=500\" alt=\"Oro Kıtaları Instagram seçkisi\" class=\"wp-image-656\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":606,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/koloboros/\"><img src=\"https://koloboros.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/canklg_worm_with_hundreds_arm_-ar_916_-profile_ugnt2yw_-v__b51ee36f-9ebf-41cc-8ac6-75b6a3d3a5c9_1.png?w=500\" alt=\"Oro Kıtaları Instagram seçkisi\" class=\"wp-image-606\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:social-links {\"size\":\"has-normal-icon-size\",\"className\":\"is-style-logos-only oro-sosyal\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\"}} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-social-links has-normal-icon-size is-style-logos-only oro-sosyal\"><!-- wp:social-link {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/koloboros/\",\"service\":\"instagram\"} /--><!-- wp:social-link {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/@Koloboros\",\"service\":\"youtube\"} /--><!-- wp:social-link {\"url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/intl-tr/artist/0MiJKUBRstJQQw2TEWyLR7\",\"service\":\"spotify\"} /--></ul>\n<!-- /wp:social-links -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-bant oro-koyu\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}, \"align\": \"full\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull oro-bant oro-koyu\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"oro-ic\", \"layout\": {\"type\": \"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group oro-ic\"><!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\": \"iletisim\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"iletisim\">İletişim</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oro-giris\"} -->\n<p class=\"oro-giris\">Soruların, işbirliği tekliflerin ve Oro’dan haberlerin için:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"oro-satin\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons oro-satin\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"mailto:kaudanaga@gmail.com\">kaudanaga@gmail.com</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n", "buy": "<!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"oro-satin\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons oro-satin\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://ejderhakitap.com/nebrukaddesar-t-can-kologlugil-koloboros?kapak-secimi=ciltsiz-normak-kapak\">Ejderhakitap</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.amazon.com.tr/dp/6259235259\">Amazon</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.hepsiburada.com/ara?q=koloboros\">Hepsiburada</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.trendyol.com/natura-yayin/nebrukaddesar-t-can-kologlugil-p-1201149806\">Trendyol</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oro-ipucu\"} -->\n<p class=\"oro-ipucu\">Ejderhakitap’ta özel tasarım zarlar ve ciltli baskı seçeneği bulunur.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n", "css": "\n\n/* Marka bandı: koyu çam yeşili, altın, Türk kırmızısı */\nheader.wp-block-template-part, footer.wp-block-template-part { background: #12291f !important; color: #eadfc8; }\nheader.wp-block-template-part { border-bottom: 2px solid #d9a93a; box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #9a2828; position: relative; z-index: 30; }\nfooter.wp-block-template-part { border-top: 2px solid #d9a93a; box-shadow: 0 -3px 0 #9a2828; }\nheader.wp-block-template-part .wp-block-site-title, header.wp-block-template-part .wp-block-site-title a,\nfooter.wp-block-template-part .wp-block-site-title, footer.wp-block-template-part .wp-block-site-title a { color: #f3d27a !important; letter-spacing: .08em; text-decoration: none; }\nheader.wp-block-template-part .wp-block-navigation a, footer.wp-block-template-part .wp-block-navigation a { color: #eadfc8 !important; }\nheader.wp-block-template-part .wp-block-navigation a:hover, footer.wp-block-template-part .wp-block-navigation a:hover { color: #f3d27a !important; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #9a2828; text-underline-offset: 5px; }\nheader.wp-block-template-part .wp-block-social-link svg, footer.wp-block-template-part .wp-block-social-link svg { fill: #d9a93a !important; color: #d9a93a !important; }\nheader.wp-block-template-part .wp-block-social-link:hover svg { fill: #f3d27a !important; }\nheader.wp-block-template-part .wp-block-navigation__responsive-container-open svg, header.wp-block-template-part .wp-block-navigation__responsive-container-close svg { fill: #f3d27a !important; }\n.wp-block-navigation__responsive-container.is-menu-open { background: #12291f !important; color: #eadfc8 !important; }\nfooter.wp-block-template-part .wp-block-site-logo img { border-radius: 3px; }\n\n/* Ana sayfa Nebrukaddesar vitrini */\n.oro-ana-kitap { background: #12291f !important; border: 1px solid #d9a93a; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #12291f, 0 0 0 5px #9a2828; }\n.oro-ana-kitap .wp-block-media-text__content { padding: 2rem 2.2rem; color: #eadfc8; }\n.oro-ana-kitap h4 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem); margin: 0 0 1rem; }\n.oro-ana-kitap blockquote { border-left: 2px solid #d9a93a; font-style: italic; }\n.oro-ana-kitap blockquote p { line-height: 1.55; }\n.oro-ana-kitap .oro-satin { justify-content: flex-start; }\n.oro-ana-kitap .oro-ipucu { color: #c9b58f; }\n.oro-satin .wp-block-button__link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #f3d27a; outline-offset: 2px; }\n\n/* Hakkında */\nbody.page.page-id-964 { background-color: #17110b !important; color: #eadfc8; overflow-x: clip; }\n.page-id-964 main, .page-id-964 .wp-block-post-content { padding: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important; width: 100% !important; max-width: none !important; }\n.oro-cam { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #12291f, #0d1f18); }\n.oro-mozaik { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: .5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 1.2rem !important; }\n.oro-mozaik > * { margin: 0 !important; }\n.oro-mozaik img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: cover; display: block; border: 1px solid #d9a93a; transition: filter .2s ease; }\n.oro-mozaik a:hover img { filter: brightness(1.15); }\n.oro-sosyal { gap: 1rem; }\n.oro-sosyal svg { fill: #f3d27a !important; }\n@media (max-width: 782px) {\n\t.oro-mozaik { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }\n\t.oro-ana-kitap .wp-block-media-text__content { padding: 1.4rem 1.1rem; }\n}\n"}